  "status": "COMPLETE",
  "decision": "MINIMAL GENERATOR FOUND (block level, held-out confirmed): a serial L0->L1->MLP2 MLP-backbone pipeline builds the acceptor payload. L2 attention is NOT part of it.",
  "memorials": "value_linearity=2.7e-6 (address-clean reconstruct analytically exact), scrub-cover empty->corrupt/full->clean=0.0, generator_ceiling M(A)-M(0)=0.289, full_clean_value_restore=0.354 (reproduces C24 +0.38). All pass.",
  "serial_structure": "Leave-block-out necessity (replicating on held-out H): L0 N_g=+0.895 [H 0.866,0.918] and 40%% sufficient alone (R_single=0.403) = the ORIGIN; L1 N_g=+0.528 [H 0.428,0.567] but near-silent alone (R=0.057) and weak with only L2 downstream (P_g=0.095) = a REFINER that requires L0 upstream; L2 attention N_g=-0.031 (H-CI incl 0) = not required for payload generation under the block intervention (L2H15 stays essential on the address path, C25). Necessities do NOT sum (serial chain: break any link, lose most).",
  "MLP_backbone": "Individual leave-one-out: MLP2 N=+0.893, MLP1 N=+0.393, MLP0 N=+0.324 (the three MLPs are the backbone); strongest attention feeder L0H7 N=+0.352, then L0H12 +0.137, L0H10 +0.104. Pipeline: L0 attn (H7/H12/H10) -> MLP0 -> MLP1 -> MLP2 -> pre-L3H1 residual.",
  "MLP2_dual_role": "MLP2 (C21 flagged it as the QUERY/ADDRESS assembler) is ALSO the dominant PAYLOAD relay here (N=+0.893). A dual address+payload role for MLP2.",
  "address_payload_separation_at_L2": "L2H15 (the ADDRESS builder, C25) is NOT a payload node (circuit value-check N=+0.001 [-0.008,0.011]); L1H12 N=-0.006. So address (L2H15/attention) and payload (MLP2) are separable within layer 2.",
  "block_vs_singleton_vindicated": "4 individual L2 heads (2.3,2.5,2.9,2.13) flag load-bearing (N_h CI-low>0) although the L2 BLOCK is not necessary (N=-0.031) -- a within-block interaction artifact (removing one L2 head unmasks another; removing all cancels). Exactly the singleton-scan trap the review warned of; the block/group test is trustworthy. Backward-pruning-with-groups design validated.",
  "value_vs_plain": "L0 recovers 40%% alone in the value-path frame (R_single=0.403) vs 14%% of A7 plain \u0394ACC -- the address-clean isolation reveals L0 is a larger VALUE contributor than the plain frame (which penalised it for not also building a clean address).",
  "held_out": "R_H(drop L2 attention)=R(A\\g_L2 on H)~1.0 >= 0.80; L0/L1 H-necessity CI-low>0; L2 H-necessity CI incl 0. Minimal generator confirmed on held-out at BLOCK level.",
  "escaped_failure_modes": "(1) value-path metric exact (value_linearity) + C24 anchor; (2) block-vs-singleton interaction caught (L2 artifact); (3) gene-split held-out replication of L0/L1 necessity; (4) MLP2 payload-necessity not conflated with its address role; (5) non-additivity respected (serial N do not sum).",
  "scope": "Value-path (address held clean), acceptor-window generation, bounds the generation feeding L3H1 (0.35 ceiling ~ C24). NOT redefined: any prior claim. Follow-ups: exact head-level minimal graph (which L0/L1 heads) + head->head/head->MLP EDGES (interaction-aware), and the semantic identity of the payload the pipeline builds.",
  "scope_correction": "Per review (2026-07-16): (1) all N/P/R are CONDITIONAL CAUSAL EFFECTS (leave-one-out necessity / normalized recovery), NOT additive fractions of the payload -- they do not sum. (2) L2 attention is not REQUIRED for payload generation UNDER THE BLOCK INTERVENTION; L2H15 remains essential on the separate ADDRESS path (C25). It is payload-null, not circuit-null."
